OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F438A1786204070
OL,3,CJobs at risk as collectable coin
OL,4,Ccompany announces administration
OL,6,FA company that makes commemorative
OL,7,Fcoins and medals has announced it has
OL,8,Fgone into administration.
OL,10,FIt is believed that The London Mint
OL,11,FOffice, not connected to the Royal
OL,12,FMint coin-making company in
OL,13,FLlantrisant, employs around 200 people
OL,14,Facross its distribution centre in
OL,15,FTonypandy and its main office in
OL,16,FLondon.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/6
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
