FL,439,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F438A1786204070
OL,3,CJobs at risk as collectable coin
OL,4,Ccompany announces administration
OL,6,FOn the company's LinkedIn page, it
OL,7,Fstates that it employs between 51 to
OL,8,F200 people. The most recently
OL,9,Favailable accounts for the company
OL,10,Fstate it employed 248 staff members in
OL,11,F2024. A large number of staff were
OL,12,Fbased at the company's processing
OL,13,Fcentre in Wales.
OL,15,FThe London Mint Office, which was
OL,16,Festablished in 2006, describes itself
OL,17,Fon its websites as "one of the UK's
OL,18,Fmost trusted suppliers of historic,
OL,19,Fcommemorative and collector coins".
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/6
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
