PN,43803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F438A1786204070
OL,3,CJobs at risk as collectable coin
OL,4,Ccompany announces administration
OL,6,FA statement posted by the company
OL,7,Fonline announced that administrators
OL,8,Fhad been appointed at the end of July.
OL,10,FIt stated: "On 31 July 2026, Michael
OL,11,FMagnay and Jonny Marston of Alvarez &
OL,12,FMarsal Europe LLP were appointed as
OL,13,Fjoint administrators of The London
OL,14,FMint Office Limited in administration
OL,15,F(the "Company").
OL,17,F"The joint administrator's encourage
OL,18,Fanyone who has an interest in the
OL,19,Fcompany's stock or assets to contact
OL,20,Fthem on:
OL,21,FINS THLMOL@alvarezandmarsal.com
OL,26,@}D@Dpo
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/6
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,439,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F438A1786204070
OL,3,CJobs at risk as collectable coin
OL,4,Ccompany announces administration
OL,6,F"The affairs, business and property of
OL,7,Fthe company are being managed by the
OL,8,Fjoint administrators who act as agents
OL,9,Fof the company and without personal
OL,10,Fliability."
OL,12,FRhondda MP Chris Bryant said he has
OL,13,Fbeen contacted by a number of
OL,14,Femployees following the London Mint
OL,15,FOffice's announcement.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/6
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,439,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F438A1786204070
OL,3,CJobs at risk as collectable coin
OL,4,Ccompany announces administration
OL,6,F"This is deeply worrying news for the
OL,7,Fworkforce, their families and the
OL,8,Fwider community," he said. "My
OL,9,Fthoughts are with everyone affected at
OL,10,Fwhat will be an incredibly uncertain
OL,11,Fand anxious time."
OL,13,FMr Bryant said his office is making
OL,14,Fenquiries with the administrators to
OL,15,Festablish what support is being put in
OL,16,Fplace for employees and "what the next
OL,17,Fsteps will be".
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G5/6
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
