FL,439,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F438A1786204070
OL,3,CJobs at risk as collectable coin
OL,4,Ccompany announces administration
OL,6,FHe added: "I'll also be speaking with
OL,7,FRhondda Cynon Taf Council, the
OL,8,FDepartment for Work and Pensions and
OL,9,Fother partners to ensure that every
OL,10,Fpossible support is available.
OL,12,F"If redundancies are confirmed I'll be
OL,13,Fasking that a local jobs and
OL,14,Frecruitment event is organised as
OL,15,Fquickly as possible to help people
OL,16,Ffind new employment and access advice
OL,17,Fand support."
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G6/6
